{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:37 2026-10-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:37 2026-10-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:37 2026-10-01 HKT</p><img alt=\"「顏色之皇」捧國慶盃\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/d0123b15ecabe0cf323acc832f038fec/2026-10/13131313.jpg\"/><p>游達榮馬房的「顏色之皇」，擅跑一千米直路賽，今日此駒列陣三級賽國慶盃，結果該駒在騎師潘頓胯下力壓同場另一匹直路賽專家「魔術控制」勝出，游達榮今季頭馬數字達至四場。</p><p>「顏色之皇」馬主顏為善說：「『顏色之王』上季尾已經跑得很好，很開心馬兒可以取得跨季孖寶。賽前我都有擔心今場有不少快馬，擔憂步速不利「顏色之皇」的發揮，幸好鞍上人潘頓發揮出色，有助此馬爭勝，希望馬匹繼續進步，再交出好成績。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5186e281eb2caa1ef2b146df59c4406f/2026-10/3d12d613-c8ce-4b55-b060-7e935ffd0014.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9679d4d531097d4815bc2d5f42c73648/2026-10/4b2e239c-19a9-4a16-bca8-c186433b57d8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/36896d4ac0ba114421a7adb2a912d7a6/2026-10/19bd5abe-b91b-4aa9-b5ab-b1ef4d1dae3d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89ddd6b0e56402a24f660728c419108b/2026-10/336d185f-b202-4a8d-b87e-c4caac110cb2.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0866d8432bb7a8c57356a9b9ae4d3ba3/2026-10/583a9b79-5e76-4d6a-811c-a4cab3bd67f3.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/73fa333ced12fe36440f7e550600fb79/2026-10/613bd8c3-c538-4d79-9088-79129f367fcb.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6df54a6f7bf3c0e38cbd5727e4d9999e/2026-10/872abedb-8859-4ebc-867c-3dc0ebfbd432.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8b148864de27723f80ab34372894926/2026-10/60887da1-601c-4133-9b1c-24b8280220b1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c6d5709720e59d5b9983b0918f846180/2026-10/60028333-6513-42a1-99c0-72309cb912ea.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f6451a3276b379313f7b98514ba372c1/2026-10/a10ac52e-57ca-41d0-80e8-5ad8a8625a79.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/375a43bad65658e56b32463c8732fb1c/2026-10/a979ce74-6